<title>${esc(title)} · BEER Redaktion</title><style>
:root{--ink:#1d1d1b;--muted:#6b6760;--line:#e3ded6;--paper:#faf8f5;--card:#fff;--red:#a4161a;--amber:#7a5c00;--green:#2d6a4f}
